Preaching the enlightened gospels of Gaming Anarchy</i></b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/225-growls","name":"Growls","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar225_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"292"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-07T03:16:44-07:00","id":1101160,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Urabyfirst</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1094068-lost-dreams-and-where-to-find-them-looking-for-lost-sne-material?p=1095844#post1095844\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Similarly to Jane (actually, with Jane on the BoMD) I'm still marching on slowly but surely with the Kingdom of the Feathered Serpent project. It's actually quite far along, and if anyone is interested in helping please let me know.</div> </div> </div> </div>I know very little of Mexican myths, but if there's anything you need written we could probably figure something out.<br /> ive actually considered to set a game there.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Alqamar Alaswad</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1094068-lost-dreams-and-where-to-find-them-looking-for-lost-sne-material?p=1095072#post1095072\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Most (if not all) material for Lords of Nightmare was saved and it's safely stored in my hard drives. I'm still trying to finish the project (there's a small group of devoted fans in Facebook) but real life keeps trying to kick me in my face.</div> </div> </div> </div>if help is needed, I'll be happy to aid. I really want to see this project come to life.<br /> <br /> -----<br /> <br /> if anyone have any contact with the old owner of SnE, I'd be happy to get some contact info.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1973-saint-michael\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1973_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1973\" data-vbnamecard=\"1973\">Saint Michael</a> : I've been trawling the wayback machine. And I'm not sure if there's any version of the threads of Shadownessence archived.</span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>__________________________________________________ </b><br /> <span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b><i>Preaching the enlightened gospels of Gaming Anarchy</i></b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/225-growls","name":"Growls","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar225_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"292"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-11T20:20:55-07:00","id":1102692,"title":"","content":"I was an admin at SnE. Try SnE at facebook?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1973-saint-michael","name":"Saint Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1973_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"183"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-12T20:41:55-07:00","id":1115358,"title":"","content":"So glad I found this thread! For the old-timers here (okay, Grumps....<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ) I went by Swordsman on SnE, but changed my handle when I recently joined this forum (different point in my life). I still have a lot of the old SnE material up to the point that I stepped down from being Praefectus of the C:tD section, including Month of the Changeling, KB:Boggan, and some Free Skies material. I've made my own website to make all of the material available to the public, as well as update Changeling links since most of the fan sites have become defunct and their links mostly dead, and share some of my own settings I've created over the years.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://theshepherdsfreehold.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://theshepherdsfreehold.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/06/trollollollo_by_xgotikox-d5piwb81.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://theshepherdsfreehold.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\"> The Shepherd's Freehold </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://theshepherdsfreehold.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\"> https://theshepherdsfreehold.wordpress.com/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> A Changeling: The Dreaming Fan Site </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Alqamar, I have some of the Lords of Nightmare material that was made up to a point and was planning on putting it on my site. Now that I see you here, I want to first ask if that would be okay with you, or if you might have some updated information. We can PM that if you'd like.<br /> <br /> Hi to all of my old SnE friends!!!!! The Dreaming still lives in us!!!!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://imgbb.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://image.ibb.co/fzeOgQ/1172c70f3ff188688852c74c8145285c_original_2_4.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> <br /> Visit my freehold for Changeling links, settings, art, and other goodies.<br /> <a href=\"https://theshepherdsfreehold.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The Shepherd's Freehold</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13648-shepherd","name":"Shepherd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-13T16:41:37-07:00","id":1115713,"title":"","content":"Oh. Hello retired-swordsman now Shepard. <br /> So glad to hear that you have preserved some of that glamour. We're still trying to locate Spikey's old stuff, but this is truly a gift from the dreaming. <br /> It does live on. And we're heading into Spring, with a c20 book. Something that would have seemed impossible for teenage-Growls who tried to grok the 2nd Edition for the millionth time","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>__________________________________________________ </b><br /> <span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b><i>Preaching the enlightened gospels of Gaming Anarchy</i></b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_l